50..127 Comment "// It tests boolean negation, integer division and remainder, list access and"
128..199 Comment "// string operations. An unstated computation type blocks a definition."
200..202 Comment "//"
203..277 Comment "// The lowering admits native primitives only. Stated division, append and"
278..353 Comment "// equality check and run. Other builtin namespace projections are refused."
354..356 Comment "//"
